{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09379","headline":"题从侄成绪西林精舍书斋 · 韦应物","name":"题从侄成绪西林精舍书斋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"栖身齿多暮，息心君独少。\n慕谢始精文，依僧欲观妙。\n冽泉前堦注，清池北窗照。\n果药杂芬敷，松筠疎蒨峭。\n屡跻幽人境，每肆芳辰眺。\n采栗玄猿窟，撷芝丹林峤。\n紵衣岂寒御，蔬食非饥疗。\n虽甘巷北单，岂塞青紫耀。\n郡有优贤榻，朝编贡士诏。\n欲同朱轮载，勿惮移文诮。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09379.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09379","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}